Throughput = \(\frac{7 \times 4096}{0.604} \approx 47483 \text{ b/s} \approx 47.5 \text{ kb/s}\)  

For window size = 17:  
Time to send 17 frames = \(17 \times 64 = 1088 \text{ ms}\).  
RTT = 540 ms. Since 1088 > 540, we can send continuously without idle time.  
Maximum throughput = data rate = 64 kb/s.  
