Combine the first three fractions into one rational function.

---

**Step 7: Combine first three**  
Let  
\[
h(x) = \frac{1}{x-18} + \frac{1}{x-72} + \frac{1}{x-98}.
\]  
We can compute common denominator:  
\[
h(x) = \frac{(x-72)(x-98) + (x-18)(x-98) + (x-18)(x-72)}{(x-18)(x-72)(x-98)}.
